{{Documentation/Header}}
Takes a utaite's page name and renders their birthday card. It reads <code>image</code>, <code>birthyear</code>, <code>birthmonth</code> and <code>birthday</code> off that page's {{T|Utaite}} infobox using <code><nowiki>{{#invoke:Utaite|getParameter}}</nowiki></code>, substituting <code>Unknown</code> for anything missing, then passes the values to {{T|BirthdayEntry}}.

Called only by {{T|ProcessBirthdayCategory}}, once per DPL result — see that template's documentation for the wider birthday system. Calling it with no page name outputs '''not exist'''.

Example:
<pre>
{{ProcessSingerPage|Amatsuki}}
{{ProcessSingerPage|Rairu}}
{{ProcessSingerPage|@gain}}
</pre>

{{ProcessSingerPage/Birthday|Amatsuki}}
{{ProcessSingerPage/Birthday|Rairu}}
{{ProcessSingerPage/Birthday|@gain}}
